      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just that one clip though. i've been looking at almost every video from the last six months and it's happening constantly. specifically the eyes—they don't seem to track movement the same way anymore, and there's this weird lag in their micro-expressions when they go from smiling to serious. it's like the \"software\" is catching up to the emotion. and honestly, their voice has this slightly different resonance too, almost too polished. it's getting harder to ignore. if it was just a glitch, wouldn't it be fixed by now? it feels like there's a reason why they aren't doing many live unscripted appearances anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
